  "P-096": {
    "_name": "少女",
    "_matcher": "【登场时】抽1弃1=Draw+DiscardOwnChosen；【启动主要】每回合1次给我方「奈美」贴≤1张休息咚=Choose(OwnCharacter+nameEquals奈美)后 AttachDon from:rest。",
